QuadTok tokenizer code release

This release is a tokenizer-only extraction and refactor of QuadTok development
revision e16c53ba40c5183b02ef09d031def138848eb3d9. It retains the released VQ
checkpoint's parameter names and the tensor-native kinship attention, hierarchical
decoding, guided search and breadth-first pretokenization ordering.

Portions derive from TiTok / 1d-tokenizer:
https://github.com/bytedance/1d-tokenizer
